## Every past MCQ on Topic 2

@py mcqs_topic 2

::: trap | Three MCQ traps in Topic 2
1. **Two "Mitchells", one idea each.** Juliet Mitchell wrote both *Woman's Estate* (socialist feminism, 1971) and *Psychoanalysis and Feminism* (1974). Check which book the question names.
2. **"Coined" versus "developed".** Crenshaw **coined** intersectionality (1989); Collins **developed** the matrix of domination (1990); Kandiyoti **coined** the patriarchal bargain (1988); Schüssler Fiorenza **coined** kyriarchy (1992).
3. **"None of these" is sometimes right.** Two 2026 MCQs (Kandiyoti; Collins) had no correct option among A–C. If the name you know is missing, choose "none of these".
:::
